Supplementary Credit Card Request Information required

Hi,

Your Supplementary Credit Card Request with the following details requires additional information:

* Supplementary Credit Card Holder Name: {!Case.cc_Name_on_the_Card__c}
* Relationship: {!Case.sc_Relationship__c}

Don’t worry, simply reply to this email, and attached copies of the following documents:

* Bahraini ID (CPR) of {!Case.cc_Name_on_the_Card__c}
* Proof of relationship with {!Case.cc_Name_on_the_Card__c}

Request ID {!Case.CaseNumber} is assigned for this request.

You can contact the contact center on +973 17123456 to check the status of your request

Open ila app

Bank ABC Tower, Head Office, P.O Box: 5698, Manama, Kingdom of Bahrain

This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to whom they are addressed. If you have received this email in error, please notify the system manager.

